B.cKa=new A.p("scope",B.U,'Optional `{table, rowId}` to open the embedded applet ALREADY SCOPED to one row (e.g. `{"table":"boards","rowId":"..."}`) \u2014 reuses the child applet\'s OWN `scopeTargets` (the same explorer-driven scoping a user gets by picking that row), so the embed opens with no unscoped list flash. Absent = unscoped default screen (unchanged behavior).',B.f,null)
